{"id":"8658210215541698","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-multitape-time-bounds.md","title":"Deterministic Time Complexity","display":"df-deterministic-time-complexity — Deterministic Time Complexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds","aliases":["73-df-multitape-time-bounds","73-df-deterministic-time-complexity"],"display":"df-deterministic-time-complexity — Deterministic Time Complexity","depends_on":["[[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]","[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-multitape-time-bounds</span><span>73-df-deterministic-time-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-deterministic-time-complexity — Deterministic Time Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9fa7db79fea5f29a\" href=\"?note=9fa7db79fea5f29a\" title=\"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9fa7db79fea5f29a\" href=\"?note=9fa7db79fea5f29a\" title=\"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 为候选运行图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DTIME}\">\\(\\mathsf{DTIME}\\)</span> 的量化中使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\">\\(\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\\)</span> 的同一语义实例。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pmin}\">\\(\\operatorname{pmin}\\)</span> 与收敛记号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_M\\)</span> 首先定义为函数图，非停机输入不属于其定义域。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HaltingRun}_M(w,m,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\;\n\\Bigl[s=\\rho\\land\\rho(0)=C_M^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;m\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\to_M\\rho(i+1)\\bigr)\n\\land\\pi_1(\\rho(m))\\in\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HaltingRun}_M(w,m,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\;\n\\Bigl[s=\\rho\\land\\rho(0)=C_M^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;m\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\to_M\\rho(i+1)\\bigr)\n\\land\\pi_1(\\rho(m))\\in\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{time}_M\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{(w,m)\\in\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\left(\\{r\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists\\rho\\;\\operatorname{HaltingRun}_M(w,r,\\rho)\\},m\\right)\\in\\operatorname{pmin}\\right\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{time}_M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{time}_M\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{(w,m)\\in\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\left(\\{r\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists\\rho\\;\\operatorname{HaltingRun}_M(w,r,\\rho)\\},m\\right)\\in\\operatorname{pmin}\\right\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{time}_M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DTIME}(t)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\in\\{S:\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(S)\\}\\;\\bigl[\n\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\land L=L(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{time}_M)=\\mathbf2^*\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(|w|\\ge n_0\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;((w,r)\\in\\operatorname{time}_M\\land r\\le c\\,t(|w|)))\\bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DTIME}(t)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\in\\{S:\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(S)\\}\\;\\bigl[\n\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\land L=L(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{time}_M)=\\mathbf2^*\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(|w|\\ge n_0\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;((w,r)\\in\\operatorname{time}_M\\land r\\le c\\,t(|w|)))\\bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>运行长度仍为从初态到接受或拒绝态的转移次数；只改用函数图排除对空候选集合取普通值。全输入停机与一组统一的渐近常数分别成项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"9fa7db79fea5f29a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"9fa7db79fea5f29a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；固定 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})$ 满足 $\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)$，见 [[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pmin}$ 与收敛记号见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]；$\\operatorname{time}_M$ 首先定义为函数图，非停机输入不属于其定义域。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DTIME}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pmin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{time}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HaltingRun}_M(w,m,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\;\n\\Bigl[s=\\rho\\land\\rho(0)=C_M^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j<m\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\to_M\\rho(i+1)\\bigr)\n\\land\\pi_1(\\rho(m))\\in\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{time}_M\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{(w,m)\\in\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\left(\\{r\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists\\rho\\;\\operatorname{HaltingRun}_M(w,r,\\rho)\\},m\\right)\\in\\operatorname{pmin}\\right\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{time}_M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DTIME}(t)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\in\\{S:\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(S)\\}\\;\\bigl[\n\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\land L=L(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{time}_M)=\\mathbf2^*\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(|w|\\ge n_0\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;((w,r)\\in\\operatorname{time}_M\\land r\\le c\\,t(|w|)))\\bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr\\}","display":true}],"bytes":2429,"backlinks":[{"id":"7e7069bd8fd38867","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DTIME}$ (deterministic time classes, see [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]])"},{"id":"5a23e63a72e2443c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DTIME}$ (deterministic time classes, see [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]])"},{"id":"1a769cdc24b3e236","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$\\operatorname{HaltingRun}$ 见 [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]，$\\operatorname{pmin}$ 见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]。"},{"id":"4aece652594d9d3c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{time}_M$ (halting-run length, see [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]])"},{"id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{time}_M,\\mathsf{DTIME}$ 见 [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]；$\\operatorname{NTimeBound},\\mathsf{NTIME}$ 见 [[73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds]]。"},{"id":"dfb238ddf618b68f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DTIME}$ (deterministic multitape time classes, see [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]])"}],"outgoing":["9fa7db79fea5f29a","773cae915e5165f3"]}